":34.18,"end":39.91,"score":0.926,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-006-006","sourceId":"b3-006-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,14],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Diamond necklaces and rings had been beautifully arranged on a background of black velvet.","start":40.86,"end":46.32,"score":0.937,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-006-007","sourceId":"b3-006-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,15],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"After gazing at the display for several minutes, Mr. Taylor went back into his shop.","start":47.27,"end":53.2,"score":0.908,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-006-008","sourceId":"b3-006-008","sourceIndex":7,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,21],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The silence was suddenly broken when a large car, with its headlights on and its horn blaring, roared down the arcade.","start":54.5,"end":62.86,"score":0.95,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-006-009","sourceId":"b3-006-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,8],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"It came to a stop outside the jeweller's.","start":64.04,"end":66.62,"score":0.93,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-006-010-p01","sourceId":"b3-006-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,6],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"One man stayed at the wheel","start":67.52,"end":69.28,"score":0.926,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-006-010-p02","sourceId":"b3-006-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[6,27],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"while two others with black stockings over their faces jumped out and smashed the window of the shop with iron bars.","start":69.52,"end":77.1,"score":0.961,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-006-011","sourceId":"b3-006-011","sourceIndex":10,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,9],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"While this was going on, Mr. Taylor was upstairs.","start":78.17,"end":81.78,"score":0.865,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-006-012","sourceId":"b3-006-012","sourceIndex":11,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,11],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"He and his staff began throwing furniture out of the window.","start":82.44,"end":86.02,"score":0.963,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-006-013","sourceId":"b3-006-013","sourceIndex":12,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,8],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Chairs and tables went flying into the arcade.","start":86.56,"end":89.64,"score":0.961,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-006-014","sourceId":"b3-006-014","sourceIndex":13,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,23],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"One of the thieves was struck by a heavy statue, but he was too busy helping himself to diamonds to notice any pain.","start":90.37,"end":97.86,"score":0.955,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-006-015-p01","sourceId":"b3-006-015","sourceIndex":14,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,8],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"The raid was all over in three minutes,","start":98.89,"end":101.5,"score":0.983,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-006-015-p02","sourceId":"b3-006-015","sourceIndex":14,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[8,24],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"for the men scrambled back into the car and it moved off at a fantastic speed.","start":102.1,"end":107.06,"score":0.985,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-006-016-p01","sourceId":"b3-006-016","sourceIndex":15,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,16],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Just as it was leaving, Mr.Taylor rushed out and ran after it throwing ashtrays and vases,","start":108.32,"end":115.09,"score":0.95,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-006-016-p02","sourceId":"b3-006-016","sourceIndex":15,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[16,24],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"but it was impossible to stop the thieves.","start":115.61,"end":118.28,"score":0.949,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-006-017","sourceId":"b3-006-017","sourceIndex":16,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,11],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"They had got away with thousands of pounds worth of diamonds.","start":119.21,"end":122.94,"score":0.987,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]}]}
